cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Quantum Projection
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Mun Seok
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x
abstract: >-
  Projection of quantum statevectors into a complex-amplitude
  holographic membrane: amplitude encoding of n-qubit states,
  outer-product holographic storage, projective measurement as the
  membrane's native recall operation with Born-like outcome
  probabilities, ket/bra split across two conjugate membranes, and
  lossy Haar coarse-graining. Verified: Bell-state projection under
  noise, non-orthogonal pattern resolution, coarse-grained GHZ
  recall. Classical emulation of quantum kinematics only; no
  speedup, no nonlocality.
keywords:
  - quantum-projection
  - holographic-memory
  - complex-hopfield
  - born-rule
  - coarse-graining
  - wave-computing
